格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DSH notification & remote-control plane: 28 outbound channels, 6 inbound controls, Native Notify & Control UI, live hot-apply, zero runtime deps.","id":"gh:1334657392","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-notifier","slug":"THEWOLFWALKER/dsh-notifier","topics":["chatbot","control-plane","deepseek-harness","dingtalk","dsh","dsh-plugin","feishu-lark","hot-apply","im","native-ui","notification","notifications","push-notifications","qq-bot","remote-approval","remote-control","slash-command","telegram"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DSH notification & remote-control plane: 28 outbound channels, 6 inbound controls, Native Notify & C"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ontrol UI, live hot-apply, zero runtime deps."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"*我们正在进行大规模重构 近期更新可能推迟*"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# dsh-notifier"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**Your agent, in your pocket.**"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"Bring DeepSeek Harness to your phone: notifications, approvals, questions, remote conversation, and "},{"id":"p5s2","text":"task/session control across **28 outbound** and **6 inbound** channels."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"简体中文 · Quick Guide · Troubleshooting · Compatibility"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"`dsh-notifier@0.13.1` · test/ 2011 tests · 2011 automated contract tests"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## What it does"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"dsh-notifier is the notification and remote-operations layer for DeepSeek Harness. It is built for t"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"he common workflow of **leaving the DSH window while still wanting to know what your agent is doing "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"— and respond when it needs you**."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- **Get notified anywhere** — task completion, approvals, errors, long-running status, and model-tri"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ggered notifications.\n- **Respond from your phone** — approve/reject, answer `ask_user`, continue a "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"conversation, steer a running turn, or switch tasks/sessions.\n- **Manage it inside DSH** — the Nativ"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"e **Notify & Control** panel is the daily control surface; the loopback Advanced Console remains ava"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"ilable for recovery and deeper management.\n- **Keep failures contained** — unsafe or unknown inbound"},{"id":"p10s6","text":" actions fail closed; outbound channel failures do not take down the rest of the notifier."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Screenshots"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"### Ask an AI to install it for you"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Copy this sentence to an AI/agent that can operate your terminal:"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"> Install or upgrade the latest stable **dsh-notifier** on this machine. First detect the active DSH"},{"id":"p15s2","text":" profile and current install source, verify the installed DSH/Node versions are compatible, and pres"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"erve the existing configuration. Do not modify unrelated plugins or print any token/secret. Install "},{"id":"p15s4","text":"from the official package, restart the relevant DSH Host once, verify the actual installed version a"},{"id":"p15s5","text":"nd the **Notify & Control** entry, then report the commands you ran, the result, and any remaining p"},{"id":"p15s6","text":"roblem. Project: `https://github.com/THEWOLFWALKER/dsh-notifier`"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"The full AI installation procedure is in AI_INSTALL.en.md."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Install manually"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Restart DSH once so the new Host plugin and `client.js` are loaded. Then:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"1. Open **Notify & Control** from the DSH sidebar, or **Plugins → dsh-notifier**.\n2. Choose a channe"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"l you already use.\n3. Enter its credentials and choose **Save and test**.\n4. If the provider only co"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"nfirms API acceptance, verify the message on your device; a provider acceptance is not presented as "},{"id":"p20s4","text":"end-to-end delivery proof."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Outbound configuration changes are hot-applied after installation. Inbound transports can still show"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" **Restart pending** when their long-lived connection must be recreated."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## Pick the mode you need"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| I want to… | Start here |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Only receive task notifications | Configure one outbound channel in **Notify & Control** |\n| Appro"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ve / answer questions from my phone | Add a supported inbound channel, then pair your identity |\n| T"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"alk to the agent remotely | Pair your identity, then send plain text in the private bot chat |\n| Ste"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"er a running task | Send `! <instruction>` from the bound private chat |\n| Manage members, bindings,"},{"id":"p24s5","text":" sessions or recovery | Open the **Advanced Console** from Native |\n| Automate or run headless | Use"},{"id":"p24s6","text":" YAML / CLI from the guide |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Channels"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"**Outbound (28):** Bark, Bell, Chanify, Desktop, DingTalk, Discord, Feishu, Google Chat, Gotify, iGo"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"t, Mattermost, ntfy, OneBot 11, PushDeer, Pushover, PushPlus, Qmsg, QQ official bot, ServerChan, Sla"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"ck, Microsoft Teams, Telegram, Webhook, WeCom robot, WeCom app, WPS Bot, WxPusher, Xizhi."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"**Inbound control (6):** Telegram, Feishu, QQ official bot, WxPusher, WeChat iLink, DingTalk."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Full channel matrix (generated from the channel registry)"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"| type | Channel | Auth | Free? |"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| `bark` | Bark (iOS) | device key (or self-host URL) | ✅ |\n| `bell` | Terminal bell (local) | — | l"},{"id":"p30s2","text":"ocal |\n| `chanify` | Chanify (iOS) | token (or self-host) |