er runtime, tests, and Advanced Console are designed to observe the same underl"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ying state rather than maintaining separate “UI truth” and “runtime truth”."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"## Need help? Diagnose first, then report"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Please **do not start by pasting a large log into an issue**. The fastest support path is:"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"1. Give an AI the troubleshooting prompt and let it perform read-only diagnosis first.\n2. Let the AI"},{"id":"p36s2","text":" identify the installed version, DSH profile/version, install source, failing subsystem, and a minim"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"al reproduction — with secrets redacted.\n3. If the problem is safely fixable locally, fix and re-tes"},{"id":"p36s4","text":"n — with secrets redacted.\n3. If the problem is safely fixable locally, fix and re-test it.\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
